understand. Beside him Perda yawned as well. "It's been a long day, hasn't it?" she

45
00:03:49.839 --> 00:03:53.392
mumbled. "I think I'll just close my eyes for a

46
00:03:53.393 --> 00:03:58.034
second." Zann was drifting off to sleep too when he heard a soft

47
